  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N593048797f364c3ea6c885a7024e8851">
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy>McClure, Robert C., et al. "Gender harmony: improved standards to support affirmative care of gender-marginalized people through inclusive gender and sex representation." Journal of the American Medical Informatics Association 29.2 (2022): 354-363. https://doi-org.ezproxy.uct.ac.za/10.1093/jamia/ocab196</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
