  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/afmo#SecaScaleUpLine">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice"/>
    <core:consistsOf rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#Seca257"/>
    <core:consistsOf rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#Seca654"/>
    <core:hasManufacturer>Seca GmbH &amp; Co. KG</core:hasManufacturer>
    <rdfs:label>seca Scale-up Line measuring station</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>The seca Scale-up Line is probably the most modern and pioneering option for determining size and weight. Firstly on account of the contactless, fast, and high-precision ultrasonic measurement. Secondly because of the ID-Display, which shows the names or IDs of patients and users during data transfer to the digital patient record (EMR). This measuring station from the seca Scale-up Line is therefore the ideal choice for EMR-integrated weighing and measuring.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
