    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A non-SI unit of pressure equal to 1/760 of a standard atmosphere (a standard atmosphere being defined as equal to 101 325 pascals). One Torr is equal to 133.3223684 pascals.</rdfs:comment>
