    <rdfs:comment>The European Heart Journal (EHJ) is an official international, peer-reviewed journal of the European Society of Cardiology (ESC). EHJ aims to publish the highest quality material, both clinical and scientific, on all aspects of cardiovascular medicine. The Journal publishes original research findings, state of the art reviews, and provide a forum for the exchange of information on all aspects of cardiovascular medicine, including education issues.</rdfs:comment>
