    <rdfs:isDefinedBy>M. Escabí, “Biosignal Processing,” in Introduction to Biomedical Engineering, ch. 11, pp. 667–746, Elsevier Inc., 3 ed., 2012. https://doi.org/10.1016/B978-0-12-374979-6.00011-3</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>Biological signals, or biosignals, are space, time, or space-time records of a biological event such as a beating heart or a contracting muscle.</owl:annotatedTarget>
